WEBVTT

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:03.860
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> A

00:00:04.873 --> 00:00:11.078
<v><b>A:</b></v> Yes, I have. I drive a lot for my job, several hours a day,

00:00:11.464 --> 00:00:13.284
and I like listening to books.

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:16.752
It’s much better than listening to the radio.

00:00:17.578 --> 00:00:21.395
I probably listen to a couple of books every week.

00:00:23.414 --> 00:00:24.040
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> B

00:00:25.045 --> 00:00:30.804
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, I’ve seen The Lord of the Rings movies at least four times.

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:33.289
They’re really great movies.

00:00:33.895 --> 00:00:38.612
I never get tired of them, I always notice something new.

00:00:40.674 --> 00:00:41.480
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> C

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:47.223
<v><b>C:</b></v> Yes, I’ve definitely fallen asleep watching a movie on TV,

00:00:47.656 --> 00:00:49.542
but never in the movie theater.

00:00:51.593 --> 00:00:52.386
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> D

00:00:53.399 --> 00:00:54.859
<v><b>D:</b></v> Yes, I have.

00:00:55.275 --> 00:00:59.978
I watched the complete fourth season of Stranger Things in one evening!

00:01:02.067 --> 00:01:02.740
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> E

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:04.979
<v><b>E:</b></v> No, I haven’t.

00:01:05.568 --> 00:01:08.608
It usually takes me a long time to finish a book,

00:01:08.936 --> 00:01:10.546
so I never read them again.

00:01:12.554 --> 00:01:13.212
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> F

00:01:14.173 --> 00:01:17.946
<v><b>F:</b></v> Yes, I loved Encanto, you know, the Disney movie,

00:01:18.118 --> 00:01:20.251
so I downloaded the soundtrack.

00:01:20.693 --> 00:01:23.867
It’s got some great songs by a lot of different singers.